#### Phase K.1 — Checkpoint Engine & Recovery System (The Safety Net)
*Target: 2 credits (Build recovery BEFORE autonomous code generation)*

1. Database Schema:
   - Create `engineer_checkpoints` (id, tag_name, commit_sha, milestone_name, classification, created_at, verified).
   - Create `engineer_change_log` (id, task_description, classification, affected_files, diff_summary, status).
2. GitHub Sync & Tagging Service (`src/lib/engineer/github.server.ts`):
   - Tag creation via GitHub Git Refs API (`refs/tags/checkpoint/...`).
   - Revert commit generation via GitHub Git API.
3. Mobile Checkpoint UI (`src/routes/engineer/recovery.tsx`):
   - Card view of all milestones and recent commits.
   - Diff preview sheet formatted for phone screens.
   - "Rollback Whole App" and "Feature-Specific Revert" actions with confirmation gates.
4. Historical Data Firewall:
   - Hardcoded exclusion ensuring code rollbacks never execute destructive SQL against `daily_bars`, `trades`, or `research_notebook`.
